+- [ ] 1.2 Keep state detection conservative: verify focused negative tests show generic drive/electric wording, pneumatic wording, embedded tokens, conflicting state phrases, and unsupported/no-product queries do not inject either electric control state.
+
+## 2. Preserve additive retrieval behavior
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Verify mocked hybrid retrieval issues source and one distinct state-specific alternate query, preserves current per-modality ID deduplication/RRF/limits, and retains source candidates when alternate retrieval fails.
+- [ ] 2.2 Verify matcher integration keeps the normalized source tender query as reranker input and `MatchResult.query` for installed-electric and actuator-ready inputs, using recording mocks rather than live services.
+
+## 3. Verification
+
+- [ ] 3.1 Run the focused query-canonicalization, hybrid-retriever, and matcher test modules, then run `python -m pytest -q`; resolve implementation-test failures without modifying GOLD, harness, holdout, supervisor, or evaluation artifacts.

